The full text of llama.cpp's license is included in LICENSE.llama.cpp.txt
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

All credit for the inference engine, model support, and performance belongs
to the llama.cpp and ggml authors and contributors. Please support and cite
the upstream project: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Optional, installed on request: pi (coding agent)
Source:  https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Package: @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent (npm)
License: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

LlamaForge does not bundle or modify pi. When you click "Install pi", it
runs your own Node.js/npm to install the published package into the
agents/pi folder next to LlamaForge; pi's own license and notices are
installed with it. All credit for pi belongs to its author and contributors.
